; The rules' phonemes. letters's record for a letter (its place i, its word's length n, the word's end card, the
; letter's record number, 0 for an apostrophe, and the word, 15 cards), first's rule, and the letter's record of the
; phonemes table (text/rules_phonemes.cards: each rule's n, the letters it says, and its phonemes, then -2; then 0s,
; and -1) in. Out, for each word, the phonemes of the first rule whose contexts both match at each letter, moving
; on by the letters the rule says (the letters it passes over, and apostrophes, get none), then the word's end
; card; anything that isn't a word for the rules (n 0) as its cards (phonemes, 30 and up; not the edges) and its
; end card.
;
